+# Proposal
+
+## Why
+
+Teams are moving to Tidy Tasks from spreadsheets. Adding hundreds of tasks one by one is impractical; they need to paste rows in bulk and see which ones were refused and why.
+
+## What Changes
+
+- Add a public helper `importTasks(list, text)`, exported from `src/index.ts`.
+- `text` holds one task per line as `title;priority;tags`. The priority may be empty (normal); tags are separated by spaces. Blank lines are skipped.
+- Every valid line is added to the list; the helper returns `{ imported, rejected }`, where `rejected` lists `{ line, reason }` for each line not added, `line` counting from 1.
+
+## Capabilities
+
+### New Capabilities
+- `bulk-task-import`: importing many tasks into a list from line-based text, with a per-line report of what was refused.
+
+### Modified Capabilities
+
+## Impact
+
+- New code under `src/domain/` and a new export in `src/index.ts`; tests in `test/`.
+- No change to existing behavior and no new dependency.
